<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>script for the vector in R6. Works for both mira and goyo.
dpi and sensitivity doesnt matter since there is very little recoil, but the screen resolution and aspect ratio does matter.

2560 x 1440 screen resolution

16:10 ratio

900dpi
sensitivity: 17

attachments: 
extended barrel
angled grip.</Description>
    <Comment>script for the vector in R6. Works for both mira and goyo.
dpi and sensitivity doesnt matter since there is very little recoil, but the screen resolution and aspect ratio does matter.
lion's gun, which is technically a vector, doesnt work with this script because it is a different type of gun.

2560 x 1440 screen resolution

16:10 ratio

900dpi
sensitivity: 17

attachments: 
extended barrel
angled grip.</Comment>
